{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_title", "source_sha256": "2255df3ba7dcd2409e2ded83a09469ff3ed3102f7f3d479c53fc91e0254db342", "ja": "プロジェクト茜ちゃん～グッズ倍増計画～", "zh": "小茜专案～周边商品倍增计划～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_synopsis", "source_sha256": "25f579e89dcf3a4154ee2eb651e4ae8f3d67ed0bc7f3583c71873f98dbd465fa", "ja": "茜のやる気は、公演のレッスンではなく\n茜ちゃんグッズ販売に向けられていた。\nプロデューサーにプレッシャーからの逃避を\n見抜かれた茜は、仲間達を前にいよいよ\n覚悟を決め、地獄のレッスンへと向かう！", "zh": "茜的干劲没有用在公演的练习，\n而是放在如何贩售小茜周边商品上。\n被制作人看出是想要逃避压力后，\n茜终于在伙伴面前下定决心，\n准备进行地狱训练！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1bdb1c4f933fdc73448576b4e68cddbebfcb31dd44a2b1cfcae8c0b7d965c503", "ja": "（この後は、茜達の公演のレッスンが入ってたな。\nみんな、もうレッスンルームに……ん？）", "zh": "（接下来替茜她们安排了公演的练习。\n大家已经到练习室了……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1001_p", "source_sha256": "53445374912fd4be63f400e68fbe67ed0b82774fd7a239156bd89ce34768b1e5", "ja": "（茜が、控え室にみんなを集めて……何してるんだ？\n少し様子を見てみるか……）", "zh": "（茜把大家叫到准备室……在做什么？\n过去看看情况吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "ed01d6187b1e39c7dedad4d55c86ae7da5b38e5dd7919cc5b95915d42247e474", "ja": "みんな……茜ちゃんは、今日ここに宣言しちゃうよ！\nセンターになったからには、全力を尽くすと！", "zh": "大家听好……小茜今天在此宣布！\n既然当上了Center，就要全力以赴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "c409dcbca2a8e077688435d8525ca8777aa1d17bceefac5e73fc1704610142d1", "ja": "わぁ～、茜ちゃん、すっごくやる気だね！\n私も応援するよ、がんばろうね♪", "zh": "哇～小茜干劲十足耶！\n我也会声援的，一起加油吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "e3665e99db5928cbdd27519a530146a4e29c7196ffd20a35a7f7bb89c34ba167", "ja": "それで、茜さん～？\n具体的には、どう力を尽くすつもりですか～？", "zh": "所以呢？茜～？\n具体来说，你想要怎么全力以赴呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "9a2760ab19c1c665c1ddbe68c14f7117e376ed283913428deb6136b2e1275869", "ja": "もちろん、茜ちゃんセンター公演限定……\n茜ちゃんオリジナルグッズを、ドカンと売り出すよ！", "zh": "那当然是大力推出小茜Center公演限定的……\n小茜原创周边啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "18f40de2b804dc65fb0d2eb5e5bd6a00c84df890158b06b9551e025a73922983", "ja": "茜ちゃんTシャツに茜ちゃんクリアファイル、\n茜ちゃんうちわ、そして目玉は当然、茜ちゃん人形！", "zh": "小茜T恤、小茜透明资料夹、小茜圆扇，\n而重点商品当然是，小茜娃娃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "8ff7abcf2b0f4545192407451b30aebea9429cf2a4de752d2c6af324b6f2ff62", "ja": "茜ちゃん人形？", "zh": "小茜娃娃？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "ed3834446cf0276f7a28dd35671aa94a34929d26498094dac51184e9f6e6b170", "ja": "あれ、しほりん知らない？\n茜ちゃんにそっくりな、カワイイカワイイお人形だよ！", "zh": "咦？志保保，你不知道吗？\n就是长得跟小茜一样，可爱到不行的娃娃喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "a65b0a1d9c130889308039eb63ecdb61eed9b6771fb8147a543908a91ffc6850", "ja": "他には、どんなグッズがあるといいかニャ～？\nみんな、アイディアよろしく☆　ニャハハ！", "zh": "其他还要推出些什么周边喵～？\n请大家踊跃发表想法☆喵哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "c12e4399081f90abb914b9c79f464c43c9fea8c49008abccc36927e517a7097e", "ja": "まったく、レッスンの相談かと思えば。そんなことで、\n私たちを予定より早く呼び出したんですか～？", "zh": "真是的，还以为你要讨论练习的事情，\n结果居然为了这种事情要我们提早过来～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "9aa38b77cf19023e99901db571374a30411b4daa2d65cd32a1f8e4b08410a606", "ja": "茜さん、やる気があるのはいいことだと思いますけど。\n熱意を向ける方向が、間違ってると思います。", "zh": "茜，我认为有干劲是好事，\n但你的热情似乎用错地方了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "cdd1ce6ea1e9f0189db56f4d9618b58d4c1bbd036695a3ed99ce63f26b39d061", "ja": "そんなことを考えているヒマがあるなら、\n少しでもレッスンをするべきでは？", "zh": "要是有时间想什么周边，\n不如拿来多做些练习吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "ea0d9fddc90408a668ef70a32dfd5f523f0fd6b65408228ad77871d477320c56", "ja": "おおっと、しほりんの正論！　でもね、考えてみてよ\nしほりん！　お金がなくちゃ、劇場は運営できないよ！", "zh": "哎呀！志保保说得很对！可是啊，你要想想啊，\n志保保！没有赚钱，剧场要怎么维持下去呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "f549c708d1de7e35bd472f69b3f8cc2721ba930a81e41f42a8b65d72c8561c81", "ja": "そこで、劇場の大きな収入源になるのが、グッズ！\nだから茜ちゃんは、グッズを作ろうとしてるんだよ！", "zh": "而剧场的一大收入来源就是周边商品！\n所以小茜才想要推出周边商品啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "630b1abd5a525615782f48bc8927de1df33613de1766ddeb49a4847e3da33300", "ja": "なるほど……茜さんの言いたいことはわかりました。\nたしかに、そういう考え方もあるかもしれませんね。", "zh": "原来如此……茜，我明白你的意思了。\n你的想法确实也有几分道理。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ca43a7eb941d17c85a304fe8ac6b07aced583e60d7b0e1cebd4b66f6c02eb6ba", "ja": "いや、そこまで経営が切羽詰まってはいないはずだ。\n……多分。", "zh": "不，我们剧场的财务应该没有那么拮据才对。\n……大概吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "13f77c2f7c86d16db68662dd9222072a0165ef22c55a5c7403c5f0f02194f8f2", "ja": "わっ、{$P$}ちゃん！？　ま、まさか\n律子さんも一緒……じゃ、ないみたいね！　ふう……。", "zh": "哇！小{$P$}！？\n该、该不会律子姊也一起……看来好像没有！呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1018_p", "source_sha256": "72f59dc27e56de7a63a4106fa0900b01885c0f815a92316f56cf10bb5b8235c6", "ja": "茜……ちゃんとレッスンしているのかと思って\n見に来てみれば、まったく。", "zh": "茜……我想说来看看你有没有好好练习，\n结果居然这样，真是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a5ac89f7c63513ad1fd4340b9d644ed4243eb71b11af2214fa997bb00a2e059f", "ja": "今はそんな事してる場合じゃないだろ。それとも、\nレッスンをサボろうとしてたのか？　だとしたら……。", "zh": "现在不是做这种事情的时候吧？\n还是说，你不想要练习？既然如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "1b1527334ed6d19001c2e761d7bbc4b33be0e20320c4809ce2c17e21507d39fb", "ja": "ち、違うんだよ{$P$}ちゃん！\n茜ちゃんは、公演を盛り上げようと思ってだね……！", "zh": "你、你误会了，小{$P$}！\n小茜只是想要炒热公演的气氛……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "ab0324c85e5254e4e0967bf5cc5acab65f2d633367a90784e897e6ac5128d6c7", "ja": "あ。はいはーいっ♪\n私、いいこと思いついちゃいました！", "zh": "啊，大家听我说～♪\n我想到一个好主意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "1f2ad6e7c77fc171a3cf7ba6fc675625a9cdea0fe93a3d8800ac89beaa5c02d2", "ja": "あっ{$P$}ちゃん、ちょっと待って！\nグッジョブ麗花ちゃん、ナイスタイミング！　何かな！", "zh": "啊！小{$P$}，等一下！\n做得好，小丽花，及时救援！是什么好主意呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1023_048rei", "source_sha256": "3fabd1bfe2faa927f6bb2afee9d607279525f5c9543227fed72080ec9e27bc75", "ja": "うん！\nあのね、等身大茜ちゃん蝋人形ってどうかな？", "zh": "嗯！\n我在想啊，要不要做个等身大的小茜蜡像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "b0a4cb8dbf398f99c760955315c5b7b8e33a3568171c5d6b43592a42ac01facf", "ja": "……なんですと？", "zh": "……你说做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "3c0a2beae19713da9b7dc244026197d7115bea2b96a4bfed679c2aa01858689a", "ja": "けっこう簡単にできるし、豪華だと思うんだけど\nどうかな？　型は、茜ちゃんからすぐ取れるし……。", "zh": "我觉得制作简单，成品也会很气派，怎么样呢？\n而且现在就能马上从小茜身上取模了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1026_031tom", "source_sha256": "abb3b2a761a45b3c2ac050d776b76a26345f7682d030ccff47eca9cca8cb7091", "ja": "あら、素敵なアイディアですね～。\nなかなかいい考えだと思いますよ～。", "zh": "哎呀，真是个好主意～\n我觉得这想法很不错喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1027_p", "source_sha256": "3b1c943326571e14221f83faa80a087cba542e50c4d7235109e78f9b2678017b", "ja": "そうだな。\nもうこの際、そうした方がいいかもしれないな……。", "zh": "说得也是。\n事到如今，就干脆这么做吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1028_023aka", "source_sha256": "d6cf39d6867cda42e382f8b1851b5e76a786a30d6aab3f7cf817d28097a7f04e", "ja": "と、朋花ちゃん！　{$P$}ちゃんも！\n765プロに茜ちゃんの味方はいないの！？", "zh": "小、小朋花！还有小{$P$}！\n难道765艺能里没有人站在小茜这边吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1029_031tom", "source_sha256": "4e2f26256d880f48c76bada008917c2e8f654cd4bfe21d516e624ac65c1165ea", "ja": "レッスンをしないセンターなんて……代わりに\n蝋人形を置いたところで、特に問題ありませんよね～？", "zh": "身为Center却不想练习……就算在台上放尊蜡像代替，\n也不会有问题吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1030_023aka", "source_sha256": "739e50d1dd5b52c3a27f9ae64bde38a44824a2ab8ffa2005817e7634161cfed9", "ja": "うにゃー！？　もしかして朋花ちゃん、\nメチャクチャ怒ってるー！？", "zh": "呜喵～！？\n莫非小朋花现在超生气的～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1031_031tom", "source_sha256": "26bedd60d3aefec284aabeb8704ce68eae9e1c29bb8d351408ab89e38afabc75", "ja": "怒っていないと思っていたんですか～？", "zh": "原来你现在才发现我很生气吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1032_p", "source_sha256": "ab23ad4830ca567ba7b62006e4ba64bd5022d9326e7441511d3fa7e4282ba748", "ja": "それは当然じゃないか？　茜。ここにいるみんなは、\nそもそもレッスンのために集まってくれたわけだし。", "zh": "她会生气也是当然的吧？\n茜，大家来这边本来就是为了要练习啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1033_023aka", "source_sha256": "fad5c6202a94828f759570599e5d0ed233a8d99974418fb99718d0d22ec5b2c8", "ja": "そ、それは……そう……。", "zh": "是、是这样……没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1034_p", "source_sha256": "a93a1e10861620521893b439824e70d129581d1b67b860f2b8bdc5419b86041a", "ja": "それに茜は、レッスンが足りなくていいステージが\nできなかったアイドルのグッズを、欲しいと思うか？", "zh": "而且，茜，如果因为缺乏练习而拿不出好表现，\n你认为会有人想要这种偶像的周边吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1035_023aka", "source_sha256": "5dd12c2c8254632cd5df40ef29c205a04ab0e5435c0d7b2653a957622e846b74", "ja": "えっと……思わない、カモ……。", "zh": "呃……小茜、觉得不会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1036_033sih", "source_sha256": "77773a86a20e61e6319f28ad2b9f9ba983e39f9163246579e1925f5f924adf90", "ja": "そうですね。私も、ステージで輝いていない\nアイドルのグッズは欲しくないです。", "zh": "说得也是，如果一个偶像在舞台上黯淡无光，\n我也不会想要她的周边商品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1037_023aka", "source_sha256": "ea434cdcec49024e1684226ac55cbc23ed84214c63c4b1d998db0c38c75e47a9", "ja": "ううっ、しほりんまで……。\nでも、わかったよ。茜ちゃん、間違ってたよ！", "zh": "呜呜，连志保保都这么说……\n不过，好吧，小茜知道错了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1038_023aka", "source_sha256": "29ccd18822f4d4cf6f854aff5376b5fc68c2e2e547c89f90b929dcd19c3741c0", "ja": "茜ちゃんが初センター公演で、一番がんばらなくちゃ\nいけないのは……すなわち、茜ちゃん自身が輝くこと！", "zh": "这是小茜第一次Center公演，\n最需要努力的……那就是，小茜自己必须绽放光芒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1039_023aka", "source_sha256": "c984d7f19fd0287fa52d20f572c87c66d5cedfe16421778e4397cbacad43f5e9", "ja": "グッズを考えたり作ったりするのは、\n歌もダンスもカンペキにしてから！だよね！", "zh": "就算要企划、制作周边，\n也得先完美练好歌唱和舞蹈再说！对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1040_031tom", "source_sha256": "633105da9d3837546ee634853276f209382bcea4e3631e8adfc36872567b61f0", "ja": "どうやら、大切なことに気付けたみたいですね～。\n改心したようで何よりです～。", "zh": "看来你终于发现最重要的事情了～\n知道悔改就好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1041_048rei", "source_sha256": "d7fc5c5a3ecbb7d71a63ad437d552a26bb3cc42769b6c92ce31cfdca15070cc1", "ja": "うーん……。", "zh": "唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1042_023aka", "source_sha256": "c47c4d931dbaabe808e1e7f598f175396edec316f14cba09b39724824fa4d605", "ja": "あ、あの～、麗花ちゃん？　さっきから茜ちゃんのコト\n上から下までじーっと見て……何を考えてるのかニャ？", "zh": "那、那个～小丽花？你从刚刚就一直上下打量小茜……\n你在想什么喵？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1043_048rei", "source_sha256": "6feffdcad2c43c42bd2ccf3d0d4676f996665b4a49799fe1b357bff183b16741", "ja": "え？　ああ、うん！　等身大茜ちゃん蝋人形を\n作るのに、ロウソク何本くらい必要なのかなーって♪", "zh": "咦？喔喔，嗯！\n我在想等身大的小茜蜡像不知道要用几根蜡烛～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1044_023aka", "source_sha256": "e0f4bb40ceff9322a7b155b40c49a58ad7923048e7941a8d3077641e879582cd", "ja": "ギニャー！？　麗花ちゃん、やめて！\n茜ちゃんは心を入れ替えた！　本当だってばー！", "zh": "呜喵──！？小丽花，别再想了！\n小茜已经改过向善了！真的啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1045_p", "source_sha256": "6caa3f9cf8abac50958e8243bf148b6660279a6eb8eed10b187729f774219db1", "ja": "あ、茜、どこに行くんだ！？\nもうレッスンが始まる時間だぞ……！", "zh": "啊，茜，你要去哪里！？\n练习的时间快到了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1046_023aka", "source_sha256": "316d60d9c0f614c3fa45ad03b94613e9538516f78ea644f6d5f625e8ef94eb88", "ja": "追わないで、{$P$}ちゃん！\n茜ちゃんは、茜ちゃんは地の果てまででも……逃げる！", "zh": "不要追上来，小{$P$}！\n小茜、小茜要逃到……天涯海角！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1047_023aka", "source_sha256": "33ace46de3bd2525cd7c19b81bc63b8f64884b34061c3747ecad6b776c685aba", "ja": "そして茜ちゃんグッズの売り上げを独り占めして、\n街中のプリンを買い占めるのだー！　ニャッハッハ！", "zh": "然后独占小茜周边的收入，\n把整个城市的布丁全都买下来～！喵哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1048_p", "source_sha256": "8481addfb0ae78aa001060528948f1d23af40811090278a23b2bb0390d3602e9", "ja": "グッズの売り上げって……\n茜、諦めたんじゃなかったのか！？", "zh": "周边的收入……\n茜，你不是死心了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1049_023aka", "source_sha256": "fc079905d9c19a0f851003bfaa14f182a705679f71ca95f9c4c5e7876275241a", "ja": "諦めるとは言ってないよ！　つまり、輝いている\n茜ちゃんなら、グッズは作り放題だというコト！", "zh": "小茜什么时候这么说了！？简单说，\n只要小茜能绽放光芒，就可以放手制作周边商品了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1050_023aka", "source_sha256": "08c8dfc62da1d5d8ff2094df816f423aee8241869a146298c1b87d807b75e452", "ja": "茜ちゃんは今！　現在！　ピカピカに輝いてるからね！\nだからグッズも作り放題なんだよ！　……ん？", "zh": "而小茜现在！就是现在！正绽放出闪亮的光芒！\n所以当然可以放手制作周边了……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1051_009rit", "source_sha256": "649d04a2b8136d61f8097f315da8e45f2ab99739d1badc726c30bdaecb5bf577", "ja": "へぇ……そう。\nそれは、黙って見過ごすわけにはいかないわね？", "zh": "哦……原来是这样啊。\n那我可不能袖手旁观呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1052_023aka", "source_sha256": "32fc2eb5ad31d3000322fa6c3d3ffe6464e348fd5992db9ce72952227b22657d", "ja": "うぎゃーっ！！　り、律子さん！？", "zh": "呜呀──！！律、律子姊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1053_009rit", "source_sha256": "2cdd73cfe19d63d79a5972fe4cd2eac101d17a3c501cb50d542c4a9aaca77eef", "ja": "レッスンもしないで、そんなくだらないこと考えて！\nおしおきが必要みたいね、茜！！", "zh": "不去练习，只会想些馊主意！\n看来你很欠教训呢，茜！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1054_023aka", "source_sha256": "f34b6fd1913ebe1e460ac5d587e92f0ee4ae36dd4e196749ce90b53c2a953566", "ja": "ち、違うよ！　茜ちゃんは改心したんだよ！　ちょうど\n今からレッスンを始めようとしてたところだったのー！", "zh": "你、你误会了！小茜已经改过了！\n现在正好要开始练习啊──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1055_009rit", "source_sha256": "b82ceb82f2a4945064878c892abecd2170c9e13eac009d6ca71d5f701e5a009a", "ja": "そんな言いわけが通用するはずないでしょ！\n観念しなさい！", "zh": "你以为我会相信吗！？\n放弃挣扎吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1056_023aka", "source_sha256": "6c2c49625c5badff0142e15fecdbd92366c3d6e01624f512ae2e7ab93b6611ce", "ja": "そうだ、しほりん！　しほりんは茜ちゃんがついさっき\n改心したの見てたよね！？　律子さんに証言してよ～！", "zh": "对了，志保保！你刚刚也看到小茜改过向善了吧！？\n快跟律子姊提出证言啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1057_033sih", "source_sha256": "ff957ebb9d11de7ca24bf98ba017a8569128ca4c6e9ca58d4b92a314774cdcc7", "ja": "改心って……。でも今逃げる時に、\n売り上げを独り占めするって言ってたじゃないですか。", "zh": "改过向善……但你刚刚逃跑时，\n不是说要独占周边的收入吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1058_033sih", "source_sha256": "49896bb2ceb5cb17e0b20ec7d45d00bcdd0d9215d17d1967fa39824e1452eaa9", "ja": "劇場の経営のためだって言ってたのは、\nウソだったんですね。", "zh": "原来说要改善剧场的经营状况，\n都是骗人的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1059_023aka", "source_sha256": "136ae07a724975d0488c276acc10d9d7b3bdb1c5c132c6a0ea6cba1f1bbd1ac0", "ja": "うっ……それはその、言葉のアヤというか、\nつい本音が漏れちゃったというか……テヘ。", "zh": "呜……那该说是小茜表达得不够清楚呢？\n还是不小心说出真心话呢……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1060_033sih", "source_sha256": "37f6b4274f539321964eb4bff6932e26bf09cde0690021177223a29efc4eda4d", "ja": "以上です。\n私からは、特に言うことはありません。", "zh": "证言完毕。\n我没有其他要说的了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1061_048rei", "source_sha256": "1af4d4408a2c2fdf31f9aea9eba940245d6659801b639b586216803439c6e8bd", "ja": "あっじゃあ、私もなくていいかな？　それでは\n{$P$}さんに、お返ししま～す！", "zh": "啊，那我应该也没什么要说了？\n那么就轮回{$P$}先生了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1062_p", "source_sha256": "d927aa13c94206c89f3f5df1b68fb091e12c37fd01f6bb7ac4e42e9369c26d7c", "ja": "う～ん……おかしいな。", "zh": "唔……真是奇怪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1063_048rei", "source_sha256": "a65b1cc2fe097ddeba9c2b2052a1153d181ae717fcbf148765a1a272cfb18b46", "ja": "{$P$}さん？", "zh": "{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1064_p", "source_sha256": "53bad6205ac078e6b47d9a33e2dbfdb855b4472b23eb15ec487f1476ed0c51b0", "ja": "確かに茜はいつもいいかげんだけど、ここまで\nステージそっちのけなのも、らしくない気がする。", "zh": "虽然茜平时就很随便，\n但这次她不断逃避表演，感觉有点反常。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1065_031tom", "source_sha256": "217b72568f9eb74ac8d5fdb7b613dc7d3626ad51f3e0ac205c2934adff8db8f3", "ja": "そうですね～、茜さんらしくありませんね～。\n何か、ごまかしているような……。", "zh": "没错呢～这样子不像茜呢～\n似乎是在隐瞒什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1066_p", "source_sha256": "e4aecde4d409b1b41d48a651891015b1f9c6fd3524ee2fbcad5344525b1116e5", "ja": "ごまかしている……。", "zh": "隐瞒什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1067_009rit", "source_sha256": "e31ff245c08c6df413b5d4344adfca4efe70ae1336f127cd848a0c516eff09c4", "ja": "さあ、茜。覚悟はいいでしょうね？", "zh": "好啦，茜，你做好觉悟了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1068_023aka", "source_sha256": "a3fcfe6932e7f695e73441be8dd3e503cba0ee528700872d6051a21698a58b35", "ja": "ニャー！　天は我を見放した～！", "zh": "喵──！上天也弃小茜于不顾了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1069_p", "source_sha256": "a5419218440d51e856b666a978540e90efba8ff4900391c35db30b67c26131ab", "ja": "ま、まあまあ、律子。ちょっと待ってくれないか？\n何となくだけど、わかってきた気がするから……。", "zh": "别、别这样，律子。你可以先等等吗？\n我可能知道原因出在哪了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1070_009rit", "source_sha256": "e357d4e3e0d1cad32c2cf3ee7ba7215da816d039fa78935a5fc31efd0d199c09", "ja": "{$P$}？\nわかったって、何がわかったんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}？\n你说你知道了，所以是什么原因呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_1071", "source_sha256": "3a209c6fa8f21c74d7b74c0957115b1c337dea5a30211a7bfe44a3c8425d7279", "ja": "プレッシャー？", "zh": "压力？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_2000_p", "source_sha256": "4ddc53155770b00d88c7c81373689cd3f7762b4246e5af2442feeb1f90ad1cf2", "ja": "要するに、プレッシャーなんじゃないかな……\nそうだよな、茜？", "zh": "简单说，她应该是觉得有压力吧……\n我没说错吧，茜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_026_2001_023aka", "source_sha256": "c9be4471b2f08ea2f2e0867fa56f5e5cc8cf9ecb7ae1e8483576d3214787805b", "ja": "ニャッ！？　そ、そんなわけないでしょ！\nそんな、茜ちゃんが緊張なんてするワケないじゃん！", "zh": "喵！？怎、怎么可能呢！？\n小茜怎么可能会紧张呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
